      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "An Chong, representing Soul Pacifying grotto-heaven, uses Lady Cold Ash’s communication method to enter Shattered Bone grotto-heaven in Eastern Sea’s immemorial black heaven and meet Granny Skeleton. She agrees to human cooperation and sends him onward to Profound Literature grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        1975
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_an_chong",
        "loc_soul_pacifying_grotto_heaven",
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_granny_skeleton",
        "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling names Granny Skeleton the current owner of Shattered Bone grotto-heaven in the two heavens. After An Chong persuades her toward the two heavens alliance, Heavenly Court ambushes and captures her on the journey, then releases her. The qi harvest fruit appears in Shattered Bone grotto-heaven as well, which Qin Ding Ling treats as leverage to rope in Granny Skeleton and other human forces.",
      "chapters": [
        2005
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-and-qi-harvest-fruit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Granny Skeleton enters Qi Sea Ancestor’s hall, bows, and states that Skeleton grotto-heaven is willing to come under Qi Sea Ancestor. He accepts her and says she will not regret joining. He then notes that Skeleton grotto-heaven is the nearest to Crescent Moon grotto-heaven, which has already fallen to Wu Shuai’s side, and asks to station troops and Gu Immortals there with her cooperation. Granny Skeleton lowers her head under outside pressure, observing that almost no unaffiliated grotto-heavens remain in the immemorial two heavens, having joined Wu Shuai or been recruited by Qi Sea Ancestor.",
      "chapters": [
        2018
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
